omas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  18 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 13 16 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm modified radial mastectomy specimen  that includes a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm attached axillary tail  and overlying REMOVED_DATE x 7 0cm skin ellipse containing a REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm nipple areola complex  located 0 8cm from the inferior skin margin  Extending superomedially from the nipple a REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm erythematous ulcer is identified with a central 1 3cm ulceration and peripheral  firm  red  slightly raised edges  extending to within 1 2cm from the closest skin resection margin  superomedially   The posterior  deep margin  contains a palpable firmness with overlying puckering of the adipose tissue  located 4 0cm from the superior soft tissue margin  and 5 0cm both the medial and inferior soft tissue margin  Sectioning through this area reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  tan white  firm  stellate mass that extends to the deep margin in the area of overlying puckered firmness  extends to the skin in the area of overlying ulceration  and to within 1 5cm of the closest soft tissue resection margin  superomedial   Apart from the mass  two other tan white  firm  stellate masses are identified  The first  measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  is located 1 8cm inferior to the main mass  1 5cm from the closest deep resection margin  and 4 0cm from the inferior resection margin  The second mass measures REMOVED_DATE x0 5 x 0 8cm  is located 0 5cm from the main mass  1 7cm from the deep resection margin  and 2 5cm from the inferior soft tissue resection margin 